# Archivo de prueba del tema: HTTP (REST Client).
@baseUrl = https://oldest-house.example.invalid/api
@token = not-a-real-token

### Lista los Objetos de Poder
GET {{baseUrl}}/objects?threat=high&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contiene un objeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/objects/OOP-0001/contain HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "force": true,
  "sector": "research"
}
